#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1453 expect=violation domain=DI
#note "Rows 1/2: DISEQ=1 twice for the same SPDEVID (DEV-1) within the same DOMAIN -> both fire. Rows 3/4: DEV-2 keeps DISEQ unique -> clean."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 2
#expectViolationAt row=1 DIPARMCD=DEVTYPE
#expectViolationAt row=2 DIPARMCD=MANUF
dataset DI
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col SPDEVID  type=Char label="Sponsor Device Identifier"
col DISEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col DIPARMCD type=Char label="Device Identifier Element Code"
col DIPARM   type=Char label="Device Identifier Element Name"
col DIVAL    type=Char label="Device Identifier Element Value"
---
S1 | DI | DEV-1 | 1 | DEVTYPE | Device Type  | PUMP
S1 | DI | DEV-1 | 1 | MANUF   | Manufacturer | ACME
S1 | DI | DEV-2 | 1 | DEVTYPE | Device Type  | SENSOR
S1 | DI | DEV-2 | 2 | MANUF   | Manufacturer | ACME
